    "detailed_description": "Monsters will appear from all directions, and you need to survive by acquiring and enhancing magics.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere is 22 magic, and there is 6 scroll to enhance magic, and there is 11 scroll to enhance character.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou can learn 6 magic, and enhance damage, speed, duration, range, cooldown, number of each magic by using scroll.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf you wanna make a many ice crystal, you need to choose magic number increase scroll.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf you wanna make a fast magic arrow, you need to choose magic speed increase scroll.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf you wanna make a giant tornado, you need to choose magic range increase scroll.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSo magic build you can choose is infinite.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBoss monsters appear at the 4th, 8th, and 12th minutes of every stage.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere is 12 stage total, and each stage has different terrain and different monsters.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFind useful scroll, enhance your magic, and survive for 12 minutes!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGood luck!",
